        		<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif">&ldquo;Utility Site&rdquo; means a parcel containing any type of utility service, located on a legal parcel of land with no association to a building and, requiring periodic maintenance or readings by utility company personnel.</span></li>
